ideo></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move carefully, control the group’s noise level, use distractions, and choose your route before something hidden in the fog notices you. Avoiding confrontation is often safer than winning it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAN YOUR ACTIONS ON THE TIMELINE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4906320/extras/825dbfc7b5a48abd813016b2b41c1b5f.poster.avif?t=1787771199\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4906320/extras/825dbfc7b5a48abd813016b2b41c1b5f.webm?t=1787771199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4906320/extras/825dbfc7b5a48abd813016b2b41c1b5f.mp4?t=1787771199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When confrontation becomes unavoidable, take control with the timeline-based <strong>Combat Sequencer</strong>. Study the intentions of your enemies, assign actions to <strong>Vagrants</strong>, arrange their movements, attacks, and special abilities on a shared timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4906320/extras/ac336da28e5718a78e028fb4c643ff32.poster.avif?t=1787771199\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4906320/extras/ac336da28e5718a78e028fb4c643ff32.webm?t=1787771199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4906320/extras/ac336da28e5718a78e028fb4c643ff32.mp4?t=1787771199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the <strong>Planning Phase</strong>, in which time stops, both <strong>Vagrants</strong> and their enemies execute their actions <strong>simultaneously</strong>. Positioning, coordination, interruption, and precise timing matter more than reflexes. A well-planned sequence can eliminate a threat before it has time to react, while a single mistake can cause the entire plan to collapse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN FROM EVERY EXPEDITION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fog'n'Silence</strong> is built around repeatable expeditions through an ever-changing open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death may end the current journey, but the <strong>Knowledge</strong> you uncover survives. Learn how the world and its inhabitants behave, complete quests, build relationships, gather bits of information to fill the <strong>Compendium</strong>, and accumulate <strong>Knowledge</strong> to unlock new possibilities for future expeditions and make Vagrants stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4906320/extras/77006d313db8d7a091e4c245c3a8e147.avif?t=1787771199\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world changes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Tower remains.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And every failed escape attempt teaches you how to travel farther next time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>", "short_description": "Lead a group of Vagrants through the surreal open world of the Afterlife. Observe their journey through the eyes of a drone operator. Hide from blind monsters. Avoid malicious fog. Embrace the Cycle. Survive. Escape.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<stron